{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322123001:1":{"text":"戻られたのですね。修道院の方は……どうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322123001":{"text":"戻られたのですね。修道院の方は……どうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322123002:1":{"text":"分かりました……私のために色々してくださったのに。申し訳ありません……","source_cn":"我明白了。很抱歉，让你们为我做了这么多事情……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D71381609CACF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322123003:1":{"text":"分かっていたのです……今の状況では、この国の人たちに私たちを信用してもらうのは無理だと……","source_cn":"其实我知道，依照现在的情形，白山的民众不可能彻底信任我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1A37F1225A0AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322123004:1":{"text":"たとえ教会が生きた屍を認めても、彼らがかつては栄えある戦士だっとことを皆が知っても……屍が人々を襲う限り、彼らに対する恐怖は消えません。","source_cn":"哪怕教会认可活死人的身份，哪怕人人都知道他们曾是光荣的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847A7A7392EA2853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322123005:1":{"text":"人々は結局私たちを恐れ、遠ざける……下手をすれば教会の心遣いまで疑われかねません。","source_cn":"到最后，人们还是会害怕我们，远离我们，甚至还会质疑教会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F55D3492BFD7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322123006:1":{"text":"それは、私が望んだ結果ではありません……","source_cn":"我……不想让事情变成这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2121C0D9D0002662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322123007:1":{"text":"やっぱり、生きた屍が人々を襲わない方法を見つけないといけませんね……","source_cn":"看来还是得找到让活死人不再攻击人类的方法才行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E29977B0B65C8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322123008:1":{"text":"はい。それをずっと考えていたのですが、彼らに真の安らぎを与えるには、やはり聖堂の方たちと協力する必要があると思います。","source_cn":"是的。这个问题我反复思考了很久，我认为想要让他们彻底安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B0A805B1BF7F119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322123009:1":{"text":"え？どうしてです？","source_cn":"咦？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA8E7BF8077E07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322123010:1":{"text":"聖光は強い浄化の力を持ちます。私たちのような亡者にはあまり効果はありませんが、理性を失い、本能のみで動く「生きた屍」には、とても有効的です。","source_cn":"圣光对亡灵有着很强的净化作用。虽然在我们这样的亡灵身上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4221441E280872BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322123011:1":{"text":"ですが、修道者さんたちはグレイヴボーンを信用していないのですよ。そんな彼らがカレリーナさんに協力するでしょうか……うう、これじゃあ八方塞がりです……！","source_cn":"可是那些修士和修女根本不信任亡灵，肯定不会愿意和卡列琳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEF6DBC51D61CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1322123011":{"text":"ですが、修道者さんたちはグレイヴボーンを信用していないのですよ。そんな彼らがカレリーナさんに協力するでしょうか……うう、これじゃあ八方塞がりです……！","source_cn":"可是那些修士和修女根本不信任亡灵，肯定不会愿意和卡列琳娜合作……啊啊啊，糟糕，这简直就是一个打不开的死结嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEF6DBC51D61CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322123012:1":{"text":"修道院の皆様に私の誠意を示せるよう努力します……ですが、今はまだ時期尚早かもしれません。","source_cn":"我会向修道院的圣职者展现出我的虔诚和诚意。但……或许不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897E4C172BDEA1ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322123014:1":{"text":"葬儀で騒ぎを起こしてしまったせいで、皆様不安がっているでしょうから……今はこの話をしない方がいいかもしれません。私も、暫くは修道院に行くのは控えます。","source_cn":"葬礼上的意外已经引起了修士和修女的恐慌……现在还是不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D81844227A0AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","femal